Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.41,0:00:59.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,﻿啊  贝壳街
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.41,0:00:59.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ah, Conch Street
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.58,0:01:01.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这里友善的邻居们迎接你的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.58,0:01:01.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,where friendly neighbors greet you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.87,0:01:04.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是个大大的微笑  跟热情洋溢的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.87,0:01:04.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with a big smile and a hearty
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.37,0:01:07.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早安  邻居
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.37,0:01:07.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Morning, neighbor
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.92,0:01:10.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早安  邻居
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.92,0:01:10.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Morning, neighbor
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.63,0:01:15.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早安  邻居
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.63,0:01:15.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Morning, neighbor
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.30,0:01:19.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就像被夹在一块白痴三明治中间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.30,0:01:19.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I live in the middle of a moron sandwich
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.39,0:01:20.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我散开
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.39,0:01:20.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Spread out
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.18,0:01:22.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.18,0:01:22.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.02,0:01:22.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.02,0:01:22.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See you later
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.22,0:01:25.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去水母田不
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.22,0:01:25.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jellyfish Fields?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.02,0:01:28.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,兄弟  我们心有灵犀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.02,0:01:28.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Buddy, we have the same brain
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.61,0:01:31.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,心有灵犀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.61,0:01:31.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Same brain
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.19,0:01:36.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有没有想过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.19,0:01:36.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Have you ever wondered
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.20,0:01:39.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在你出门时  你的家会干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.20,0:01:39.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,what does your house do when you go out?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.37,0:01:43.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早安  像像
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.37,0:01:43.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Morning, Tiki
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.45,0:01:44.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早安  萝萝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.45,0:01:44.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Morning, Piney
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.41,0:01:47.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,希望海绵宝宝没害你整晚睡不着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.41,0:01:47.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I hope SpongeBob didn't keep you up all night
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.83,0:01:49.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,毕竟他晚上睡觉在狂笑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.83,0:01:49.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,laughing in his sleep
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.71,0:01:50.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,完全不会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.71,0:01:50.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not at all
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.63,0:01:53.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥抱怨这件事倒害我整晚睡不着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.63,0:01:53.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward complaining about it kept me up all night
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.59,0:01:59.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,石石说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.59,0:01:59.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What did Rocky say?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.80,0:02:00.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.80,0:02:00.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He said
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.64,0:02:03.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星睡得跟石头似的  我也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.64,0:02:03.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Patrick slept like a rock and so did I"
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.14,0:02:11.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他说  滚石不生苔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.14,0:02:11.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He said, "A rolling stone gathers no moss
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.23,0:02:16.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但是苔滚多聚石
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.23,0:02:16.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but a mossy roll gathers many stones"
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.69,0:02:19.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好深刻啊  石石
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.69,0:02:19.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's very profound, Rocky
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.11,0:02:21.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊  而且他还是用拉丁语讲的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.11,0:02:21.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and he said it in Latin
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.91,0:02:29.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.91,0:02:29.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not again
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.37,0:02:31.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,赶快把石头都聚起来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.37,0:02:31.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Round up the rocks and make it quick
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.63,0:02:33.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还得赶进度呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.63,0:02:33.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we got a schedule to keep
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.55,0:02:43.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,石石说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.55,0:02:43.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What did Rocky say?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.47,0:02:44.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.47,0:02:44.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He said
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.06,0:02:46.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,救命  我被绑架了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.06,0:02:46.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Help, I'm being rock-napped"
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.39,0:02:47.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.39,0:02:47.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.60,0:02:49.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,石石向来都是理智的代表
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.60,0:02:49.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Rocky is always the voice of reason
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.98,0:02:52.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他在这种情况会怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.98,0:02:52.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What would he do in this situation?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.19,0:02:55.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他刚告诉我们要干嘛了  必须去救他
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.19,0:02:55.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He just told us what to do, we gotta help him
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.99,0:03:01.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们来了  石石
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.99,0:03:01.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're coming, Rocky
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.84,0:03:18.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.84,0:03:18.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait for me
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.18,0:03:24.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还好我有住房保险
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.18,0:03:24.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing I have homeowner's insurance
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.18,0:03:25.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.18,0:03:25.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good luck with that
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.14,0:03:27.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们跟丢了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.14,0:03:27.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We lost him
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.27,0:03:28.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得跟人问问看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.27,0:03:28.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We should ask around
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.64,0:03:31.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许有人看到卡车往哪开了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.64,0:03:31.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe someone saw which way the truck went
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.89,0:03:32.98,标准-Chi,,0,700,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.89,0:03:32.98,标准-Eng,,0,700,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.23,0:03:34.44,标准-Chi,,1100,0,0,,有看到一辆卡车
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.23,0:03:33.77,标准-Eng,,1100,0,0,,Did you happen
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.77,0:03:34.44,标准-Eng,,1100,0,0,,to see a truck
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.44,0:03:35.94,标准-Chi,,1100,0,0,,满载石头经过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.44,0:03:35.94,标准-Eng,,1100,0,0,,full of rocks go by here?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.94,0:03:37.36,标准-Chi,,0,700,0,,房子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.94,0:03:37.36,标准-Eng,,0,700,0,,Houses
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.36,0:03:46.58,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1060,350)}礁石影院
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.86,0:03:40.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那些可怜的住户
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.86,0:03:40.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Those poor little occupants
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.40,0:03:43.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不习惯看到我们房子四处走动
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.40,0:03:43.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,aren't used to seeing us houses all up and about
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.70,0:03:45.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们需要的是伪装
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.70,0:03:45.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What we need are disguises
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.58,0:03:54.17,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(382,818)}卢看看眼镜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.58,0:03:54.17,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1620,820)}帽戴帽男装
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.56,0:04:12.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.56,0:04:12.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.85,0:04:14.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,卡车在那
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.85,0:04:14.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's the truck
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.15,0:04:16.81,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1556,640)}拉绳停车
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.36,0:04:25.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.36,0:04:25.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.82,0:04:28.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁都有不小心的时候嘛  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.82,0:04:28.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It happens to the best of us, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.33,0:04:31.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你家宝宝很可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.33,0:04:31.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And your baby is adorable
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.79,0:04:33.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.79,0:04:33.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.87,0:04:39.80,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1742,478)}加油站
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.63,0:04:36.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,找到石石了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.63,0:04:36.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's Rocky
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.42,0:04:38.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们来救你了  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.42,0:04:38.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We got you, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.54,0:04:39.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,慢慢来不着急
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.54,0:04:39.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Easy does it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.47,0:04:45.30,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(562,840)}裤头村\N石头形状气球
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.67,0:04:45.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,石头形状的气球
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.67,0:04:45.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Rock-shaped balloons?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.51,0:04:46.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁会买那玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.51,0:04:46.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who would want that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.06,0:04:56.90,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(254,862)}即将发售
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.06,0:04:56.90,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1660,862)}出售
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.10,0:04:59.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,新婚夫妇绝对会爱上这间小房子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.10,0:04:57.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, this is a nice little house
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.31,0:04:59.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,two newlyweds would love
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.69,0:05:03.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从外面看不是很宽敞啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.69,0:05:03.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look very spacious from the outside
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.65,0:05:07.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要以带刺的皮取菠萝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.65,0:05:07.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, now, don't judge a pineapple by its spiky rind
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.32,0:05:09.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来进去看一眼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.32,0:05:09.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look inside
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.16,0:05:15.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这地方用来当俱乐部刚刚好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.16,0:05:15.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This place would make an awesome clubhouse
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.55,0:05:21.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,破房子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.55,0:05:21.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Dumb house
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.30,0:05:25.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,连除虫公司都不用叫
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.30,0:05:25.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And I didn't even need to call pest control
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.93,0:05:34.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.93,0:05:34.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:34.35,0:05:36.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你差点又被卖了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.35,0:05:36.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You were almost sold again
Dialogue: 1,0:05:36.39,0:05:40.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,毕竟我采光好  而且还挺有乡村风情
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.39,0:05:40.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I do have rustic charm with lots of light
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.65,0:05:42.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是放弃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.65,0:05:42.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We might as well give up
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.53,0:05:44.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,根本找不到石石
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.53,0:05:44.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're never gonna find Rocky
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.74,0:05:45.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.74,0:05:45.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You, uh
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.61,0:05:46.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在找人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.61,0:05:46.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,looking for someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.82,0:05:55.91,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1474,380)}危房
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.20,0:05:48.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.20,0:05:48.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.78,0:05:51.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,如果我在找人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.78,0:05:51.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, if I was looking for someone
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.20,0:05:55.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就会去问镇上唯一能看到一切的那位
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.20,0:05:55.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd ask the only one in town who sees everything
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.79,0:05:58.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是灯塔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.79,0:05:58.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The lighthouse
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.25,0:05:59.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还真是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.25,0:05:59.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.54,0:06:01.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢老人家
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.54,0:06:01.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, old timer
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.46,0:06:02.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,乐意帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.46,0:06:02.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Happy to help
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.17,0:06:05.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,永别了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.17,0:06:05.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welp, goodbye forever
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.97,0:06:11.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.97,0:06:11.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.80,0:06:13.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.80,0:06:13.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You want something?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.39,0:06:17.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你今天有看到一辆装满石头的卡车吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.39,0:06:17.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did you happen to see a truck full of rocks today?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.31,0:06:19.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我看到了很多东西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.31,0:06:19.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I see a lot of things
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.23,0:06:22.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有时我的记忆会有点雾蒙蒙的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.23,0:06:22.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sometimes my memory is a little foggy
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.48,0:06:26.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许来点60瓦灯泡能唤醒你的记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.48,0:06:26.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe some 60 watts will jog your memory?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:27.90,0:06:29.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有钨丝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.90,0:06:29.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tungstens
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.03,0:06:32.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对对  我看到卡车了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.03,0:06:32.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, I saw the truck
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.87,0:06:34.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你看到它去哪了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.87,0:06:34.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did you see where it went?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.04,0:06:36.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.04,0:06:36.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.29,0:06:39.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它可以走的方向太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.29,0:06:39.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,there's so many directions it could have gone
Dialogue: 1,0:06:39.25,0:06:41.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们还藏着一手  老大
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.25,0:06:41.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They're holding out on us, boss
Dialogue: 1,0:06:41.88,0:06:43.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那现在呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.88,0:06:43.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How about now?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.67,0:06:44.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.67,0:06:44.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.25,0:06:50.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我看到卡车朝着裤头村监狱开去了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.25,0:06:47.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Last I saw it, that truck was headed
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.80,0:06:50.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,straight for Bikini Bottom Prison
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.64,0:06:51.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,监狱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.64,0:06:51.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.89,0:06:54.22,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(958,216)}裤头村监狱
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.56,0:07:04.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可悲的囚犯们  开始砸石头吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.56,0:07:04.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Alright, heartbreakers, start breaking some rocks
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.74,0:07:18.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那些囚犯很爱砸他们的石头
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.74,0:07:18.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The boys do love smashing their rocks
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.79,0:07:26.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那块石头想被砸之前先开溜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.79,0:07:26.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That rock is making a break before he's broke
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.79,0:07:26.84,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(1326,920)}砸
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.17,0:07:30.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太好笑了  汤姆
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.17,0:07:30.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's a good one, Tom
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.59,0:07:34.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,回到石头堆里去吧  石头
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.59,0:07:34.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Back on the rock pile, rock
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.01,0:07:36.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,囚犯们  砸那块石头
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.01,0:07:36.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Boys, smash that rock
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.81,0:07:38.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这就砸  老大
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.81,0:07:38.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Smashin' rock, boss
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.27,0:07:46.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,见到你  我也很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.27,0:07:46.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to see you too
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.23,0:07:48.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别担心  石石
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.23,0:07:48.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Rocky
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.44,0:07:50.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这就把你从这里救出去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.44,0:07:50.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we're busting you out of here
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.58,0:08:00.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是要怎么绕过这么多狱警
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.58,0:08:00.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But how are we gonna get past all these guards?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.04,0:08:03.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,石石说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.04,0:08:03.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What did Rocky say?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.96,0:08:06.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他说  那些狱警好像很渴的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.96,0:08:06.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He said, "Those guards look thirsty"
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.79,0:08:08.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好主意  像像
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.79,0:08:08.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Great idea, Tiki
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.88,0:08:10.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,新鲜现挤
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.88,0:08:10.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Freshly squeezed
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.64,0:08:20.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,菠萝汁
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.64,0:08:20.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pineapple juice
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.89,0:08:21.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好疼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.89,0:08:21.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It burns
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.93,0:08:24.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,却又对健康有很多好处
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.93,0:08:24.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But it has so many health benefits
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.57,0:08:31.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别急着走啊  家伙们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.57,0:08:31.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not so fast, home slice
Dialogue: 1,0:08:31.49,0:08:33.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是监狱皮特
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.49,0:08:33.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's Prison Pete
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.24,0:08:39.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错  你们三个越狱者都被软禁了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.24,0:08:36.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right, and you three jail-breakers
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.45,0:08:39.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,are all under house arrest
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.24,0:08:39.24,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(1292,920)}家
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.24,0:08:41.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,石石不属于这里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.24,0:08:41.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Rocky doesn't belong here
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.70,0:08:45.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是被采石头的人误绑过来的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.70,0:08:45.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He was abducted mistakenly by rock collectors
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.50,0:08:48.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他可不止是随便什么大石头
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.50,0:08:48.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's not just some random boulder
Dialogue: 1,0:08:48.96,0:08:51.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是别人的家
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.96,0:08:51.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's somebody's home
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.42,0:08:52.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.42,0:08:52.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's true
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.26,0:08:56.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们劫你狱只是为了让我们兄弟越狱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.26,0:08:56.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We only crashed your slammer to break our buddy out
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.39,0:08:57.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,带他回家去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.39,0:08:57.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and take him home
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.80,0:08:59.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.80,0:08:59.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're so sorry
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.85,0:09:04.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,犯法之前早该这么想了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.85,0:09:01.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You should have thought about that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.56,0:09:04.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,before you broke the law
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.86,0:09:13.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是我听过最悲惨的故事了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.86,0:09:13.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That is the saddest story I've ever heard
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.65,0:09:17.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许我错怪你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.65,0:09:17.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe I've misjudged you
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.99,0:09:21.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,取消你们的软禁
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.99,0:09:21.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your house arrest is revoked
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.29,0:09:24.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢  监狱皮特
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.29,0:09:24.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Prison Pete
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.21,0:09:27.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,趁他没反悔  赶快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.21,0:09:27.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here before he changes his mind
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.71,0:09:34.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,越狱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.71,0:09:34.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jailbreak
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.34,0:09:40.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我本来要开的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.34,0:09:40.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was gonna open that
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.56,0:09:44.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,萝萝  越来越晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.56,0:09:44.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Piney, it's getting late
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.23,0:09:47.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,趁我们房主还没回家  我们快先回家
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.23,0:09:47.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We better get home before our homeowners do
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.65,0:09:52.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝和派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.65,0:09:52.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob and Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.44,0:09:54.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走小路
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.44,0:09:54.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Take the alley
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.36,0:09:59.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.36,0:09:59.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse you
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.37,0:10:00.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.37,0:10:00.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.87,0:10:01.74,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1382,564)}铆钉咖啡店
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.87,0:10:02.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.87,0:10:02.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.20,0:10:04.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,向后转
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.20,0:10:04.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,About-face
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.62,0:10:09.79,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1348,320)}预制住宅
Dialogue: 1,0:10:07.50,0:10:09.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,自由了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.50,0:10:09.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're free
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.79,0:10:13.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要赶不上了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.79,0:10:13.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're not gonna make it
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.92,0:10:16.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,石石说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.92,0:10:16.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Rocky said
Dialogue: 1,0:10:16.01,0:10:16.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我听到了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.01,0:10:16.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I heard him
Dialogue: 1,0:10:16.97,0:10:18.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他说  骑我回家
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.97,0:10:18.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He said, "Ride me home"
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.35,0:10:27.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,赶到了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.35,0:10:27.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We made it
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.14,0:10:29.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,慢点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.14,0:10:29.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Slow down
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.02,0:10:29.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,慢点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.02,0:10:29.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Slow down
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.90,0:10:30.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在尽力了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.90,0:10:30.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm trying
Dialogue: 1,0:10:30.94,0:10:31.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在尽力了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.94,0:10:31.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm trying
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.25,0:10:49.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,明天见  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.25,0:10:49.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:10:49.00,0:10:51.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,明天见  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.00,0:10:51.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.38,0:10:53.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,明天见  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.38,0:10:53.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:10:53.63,0:10:55.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,才不要见
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.63,0:10:55.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not if I can help it
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.80,0:11:03.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能当回甜蜜的家真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.80,0:11:03.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's good to be home sweet home
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.97,0:11:04.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,逮到了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.97,0:11:04.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gotcha
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.85,0:11:07.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们引发了大越狱  必须逮捕你们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.85,0:11:07.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're all under arrest for causing a prison break
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.94,0:11:12.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,石石说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.94,0:11:12.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What did Rocky say?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.31,0:11:16.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我说  快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.31,0:11:16.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I said, run
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.20,0:11:20.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.20,0:11:20.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.20,0:11:22.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,地震了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.20,0:11:22.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Earthquake
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.49,0:11:23.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,救命
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.49,0:11:23.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Help
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.62,0:11:30.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我平常不是有个房子的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.62,0:11:30.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't I usually have a house?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.13,0:11:36.71,起司 一般标题,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fsp40\c&H00FFC1&}海绵宝宝\N{\fs30} \N{\fs175}改装记
