Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.76,0:11:44.18,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.74\pos(640,598)}监制
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.76,0:11:44.18,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1468.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.30,0:11:47.64,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(364,402)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.55,0:11:47.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,﻿啊  蟹堡王的午餐时间
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.55,0:11:47.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ah, lunchtime at zee Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.64,0:11:53.06,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(642,308)}此处点餐
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.64,0:11:49.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在这可以看到蟹堡王的员工们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.64,0:11:49.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,where we find our Krusty crew
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.64,0:11:52.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,被饥饿的客潮所淹没
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.64,0:11:52.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,overwhelmed by hungry customers
Dialogue: 1,0:11:55.40,0:11:57.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的蟹黄堡在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.40,0:11:57.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where's my Krabby Patty?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.44,0:12:00.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是餐点再不到我手上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.44,0:12:00.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If I don't get my order soon
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.78,0:12:03.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那我午餐就吃烤章鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.78,0:12:03.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm having grilled octopus for lunch
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.32,0:12:07.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡能不能做快一点  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.32,0:12:07.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you hurry up with those patties, SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:07.03,0:12:10.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那群食人族  我是说客人们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.03,0:12:10.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The cannibals, I mean, customers
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.20,0:12:11.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就快要不耐烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.20,0:12:11.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,are getting restless
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.96,0:12:14.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,遵命  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:14.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aye-aye, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:12:25.47,0:12:26.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,做蟹黄堡的手抽筋了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.47,0:12:26.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patty cramp
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.39,0:12:30.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事  稍微抽筋一下而已
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.39,0:12:30.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, it's just a little charley sea-horse
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.39,0:12:30.18,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(1024,920)}海马
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.81,0:12:34.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,用另一只手就行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.81,0:12:34.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll just use my other arm
Dialogue: 1,0:12:34.31,0:12:36.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还好我双手万能  蟹黄堡随便做
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.31,0:12:36.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good thing I'm patty-dextrous
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.82,0:12:38.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,两只手都抽筋了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.82,0:12:38.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Double cramp
Dialogue: 1,0:12:43.28,0:12:44.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.28,0:12:44.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:12:44.24,0:12:45.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,磨蹭什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.24,0:12:45.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's the holdup?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.29,0:12:50.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.29,0:12:50.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:12:50.74,0:12:54.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,煎炸厨师又废了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.74,0:12:54.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We have another fry cook fiasco
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.63,0:12:58.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你附肢竟然病变了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.63,0:12:58.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Holy appendage affliction
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.29,0:13:02.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那可是我见过最严重的锅铲综合征了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.29,0:13:02.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's the worst case of spatula syndrome I've ever seen
Dialogue: 1,0:13:02.46,0:13:04.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没事  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.46,0:13:04.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.22,0:13:05.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是可以做蟹黄堡的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.22,0:13:05.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can still make patties
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.88,0:13:06.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.88,0:13:06.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.72,0:13:09.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.72,0:13:09.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, laddie
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.72,0:13:11.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是不快点给客人做吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.72,0:13:11.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,if we don't feed these customers soon
Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.72,0:13:13.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,客人就会把章鱼哥给吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.72,0:13:13.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,they're gonna gobble up Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.73,0:13:19.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是时候启动紧急煎炸厨师了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.73,0:13:19.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Time to activate the emergency fry cook
Dialogue: 1,0:13:41.92,0:13:43.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么办  珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.92,0:13:43.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to do, Sandy
Dialogue: 1,0:13:43.59,0:13:45.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我两只手臂都累废了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.59,0:13:45.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've worn out both of my arms
Dialogue: 1,0:13:46.13,0:13:49.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再也做不了蟹黄堡了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.13,0:13:49.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll never flip a Krabby Patty again
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.89,0:13:53.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不用烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.89,0:13:53.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't you fret
Dialogue: 1,0:13:54.10,0:13:56.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我这边放了不少备用零件呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.10,0:13:56.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've got plenty of spare parts lying around
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.48,0:13:59.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,马上就修好你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.48,0:13:59.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll fix you right up
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.15,0:14:02.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.15,0:14:02.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:14:02.82,0:14:03.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.82,0:14:03.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.53,0:14:08.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这些应该行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.53,0:14:08.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,These'll do
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.37,0:14:14.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好痒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.37,0:14:14.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That tickles
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.25,0:14:18.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样应该行了  先翻几下试试
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.25,0:14:18.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That oughta do it, give 'em a test flip
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.00,0:14:24.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.00,0:14:24.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Heads up
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.30,0:14:34.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来你准备好了  小弟
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.30,0:14:34.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think you're ready, partner
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.56,0:14:41.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,猜猜谁有新手臂了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.56,0:14:41.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Guess who has new arms
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.03,0:14:46.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早该来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.03,0:14:46.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's about time
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.70,0:14:50.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢天谢地你回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.70,0:14:50.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank the Navy's gravy, you're back
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.49,0:14:54.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的紧急煎炸厨师活干得不是很顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.49,0:14:54.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me emergency fry cook isn't working out too well
Dialogue: 1,0:14:59.87,0:15:01.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放心  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.87,0:15:01.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.83,0:15:03.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,接下来交给我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.83,0:15:03.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll take it from here
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.83,0:15:42.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡做得太多
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.83,0:15:42.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've cooked so many patties
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.62,0:15:44.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,配料都要用光了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.62,0:15:44.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm running out of ingredients
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.46,0:15:49.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该去一趟蟹堡菜园了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.46,0:15:49.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Time for a little visit to the Krusty garden
Dialogue: 1,0:16:03.77,0:16:05.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别忘了腌椰菜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.77,0:16:05.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't forget the pickles
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.69,0:16:12.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在去面包房拿点面包
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.69,0:16:12.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now to grab some buns from the bun shed
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.24,0:16:21.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡做快一点  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.24,0:16:21.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hurry up with those patties, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.75,0:16:23.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,暴民又饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.75,0:16:23.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The mob is hungry again
Dialogue: 1,0:16:27.63,0:16:31.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的海绵腿跟不上新升级机械臂的速度
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.63,0:16:31.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My spongy legs can't keep up with my fancy new arms
Dialogue: 1,0:16:31.38,0:16:33.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该再来升级一下了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.38,0:16:33.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Time for another upgrade
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.26,0:16:35.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.26,0:16:35.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sandy
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.05,0:16:37.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有什么事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.05,0:16:37.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What can I do you for?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:37.51,0:16:40.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的腿太弱了  又太慢了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.51,0:16:40.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My legs are too weak and too slow
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.31,0:16:42.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,两条新机械腿马上来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.31,0:16:42.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Two new robot legs coming right up
Dialogue: 1,0:16:43.64,0:16:45.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.64,0:16:45.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here you go
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.99,0:16:54.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好一对飞毛腿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.99,0:16:54.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now that's a speedy set of stems
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.29,0:17:10.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝的花俏机械臂帮我发大财了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.29,0:17:10.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob's fancy new limbs are making me tons of money
Dialogue: 1,0:17:13.09,0:17:13.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.09,0:17:13.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:17:14.17,0:17:16.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,觉得我的飞毛腿怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.17,0:17:16.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you think of my lightning fast legs?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.68,0:17:20.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我能同时出现在所有地方
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.68,0:17:20.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can be everywhere, all at once
Dialogue: 1,0:17:21.35,0:17:24.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,既然你这么快  咋不把我的活也干了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.35,0:17:24.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If you're so speedy, why don't you do my job too?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:26.23,0:17:28.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你可真大方
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.23,0:17:28.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's so generous of you
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.86,0:17:34.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,虽然这是牺牲  但我会忍痛的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.86,0:17:34.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's a sacrifice, but I'll try to bear the pain
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.61,0:17:39.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,应该买蟹黄堡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.61,0:17:39.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Should I get a Krabby Patty?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.62,0:17:41.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是咸味海热狗呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.62,0:17:41.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or a Salty Seadog?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.62,0:17:46.54,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(962,634)}蟹黄堡                                                                          咸味海热狗
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.99,0:17:43.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.99,0:17:43.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Krabby Patty?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.16,0:17:45.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是咸味海热狗呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.16,0:17:45.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or Salty Seadog?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.62,0:17:46.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.62,0:17:46.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Krabby Patty?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.54,0:17:49.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.54,0:17:49.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Krabby Patty?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.71,0:17:51.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,75,,十分钟后
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.09,0:17:54.17,标准-Chi,,0,1000,0,,还是咸味海热狗呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.09,0:17:54.17,标准-Eng,,0,1000,0,,Or Salty Seadog
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.17,0:17:57.13,标准-Chi,,0,1000,0,,真希望能读他的心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.17,0:17:57.13,标准-Eng,,0,1000,0,,I wish I could just read his mind
Dialogue: 1,0:17:57.13,0:17:59.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让我猜猜  要新眼睛吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.13,0:17:59.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let me guess, new eyes?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.18,0:18:00.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.18,0:18:00.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:18:02.64,0:18:04.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有了这对高科技眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.64,0:18:04.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,With these hi-tech peepers
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.56,0:18:06.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就能扫描客人的大脑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.56,0:18:06.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you can scan customers' brains
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.35,0:18:09.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,提前客人一步知道要点什么餐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.35,0:18:09.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and know their order before they do
Dialogue: 1,0:18:16.70,0:18:20.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你要的是蟹堡儿童餐  额外附赠玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.70,0:18:20.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You want a Krabby kids meal with extra toys
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.33,0:18:22.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.33,0:18:22.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're right
Dialogue: 1,0:18:23.49,0:18:25.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,万岁
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.49,0:18:25.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Huzzah
Dialogue: 1,0:18:36.05,0:18:38.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,尝这么多肉饼的味道得要一辈子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.05,0:18:38.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It'll take forever to taste test all these patties
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.93,0:18:41.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是我的海绵肉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.93,0:18:41.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If only my fleshy sponge-mouth
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.39,0:18:43.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,速度能跟上我的新假肢就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.39,0:18:43.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,could keep up with my new limbs
Dialogue: 1,0:18:44.97,0:18:46.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.97,0:18:46.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy
Dialogue: 1,0:18:46.89,0:18:48.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这次又要什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.89,0:18:48.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What is it this time?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.02,0:18:50.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,新肚脐眼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.02,0:18:50.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,New belly button?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.10,0:18:51.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,升级脾脏
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.10,0:18:51.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Upgrade your spleen?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:51.31,0:18:52.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,仿生屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.31,0:18:52.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Bionic butt?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:53.19,0:18:53.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.19,0:18:53.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sandy
Dialogue: 1,0:18:53.86,0:18:55.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我需要一张新脸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.86,0:18:55.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I need a new face
Dialogue: 1,0:18:55.86,0:18:59.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  你本来就有80%都是脸了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.86,0:18:59.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, you're almost 80 percent face as it is
Dialogue: 1,0:18:59.40,0:19:01.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,换完之后  真正的你就一点都不剩了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.40,0:19:01.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There won't be nothing left of the real you
Dialogue: 1,0:19:01.95,0:19:03.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我愿意付出一切代价
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.95,0:19:03.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll do whatever it takes
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.49,0:19:06.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,成为最棒的煎炸厨师
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.49,0:19:06.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to be the best fry cook I can be
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.12,0:19:07.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,75,,第二天
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.33,0:19:10.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我最爱的赚钱半机器人怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.33,0:19:10.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How's my favorite money-making cyborg doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.96,0:19:14.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.96,0:19:14.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You, uh
Dialogue: 1,0:19:14.25,0:19:16.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,样子今天有点不一样了  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.25,0:19:16.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,look a little different today, kiddo
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.63,0:19:19.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我现已百分之百机械化
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.63,0:19:19.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am now 100 percent cybernetic
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.59,0:19:21.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因此  请称呼我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.59,0:19:21.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Henceforth, refer to me as
Dialogue: 1,0:19:22.68,0:19:24.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵钢骨
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.68,0:19:24.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBorg
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.47,0:19:28.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,爱咋叫咋叫  只要帮我发财就行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.47,0:19:26.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll call you whatever you want
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.10,0:19:28.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,as long as you keep making me rich
Dialogue: 1,0:19:39.19,0:19:40.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上菜了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.19,0:19:40.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Order up
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.78,0:19:42.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.78,0:19:42.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good job, boy-o
Dialogue: 1,0:19:49.08,0:19:50.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,检测到液体
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.08,0:19:50.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Liquid detected
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.37,0:19:51.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,故障
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.37,0:19:51.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Malfunction
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.50,0:19:53.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,启动防御模式
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.50,0:19:53.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Activating defense mode
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.64,0:20:07.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.64,0:20:07.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.56,0:20:08.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,摧毁
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.56,0:20:08.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Destroy
Dialogue: 1,0:20:16.02,0:20:17.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,救命啊  珊迪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.02,0:20:17.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Help me, Sandy
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.02,0:20:19.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这个新奇古怪的海绵宝宝失控了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.02,0:20:19.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This newfangled SpongeBob has gone loco
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.15,0:20:24.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我一下子就可以到
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.15,0:20:24.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll be there in two shakes of a cyborg's antenna
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.29,0:20:33.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,摧毁
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.29,0:20:33.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Destroy
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.54,0:20:35.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.54,0:20:35.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Shoot
Dialogue: 1,0:20:35.25,0:20:36.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得想想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.25,0:20:36.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I gotta do something
Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.00,0:20:40.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还好没把这些丢掉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.00,0:20:40.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good thing I didn't throw these away
Dialogue: 1,0:20:44.01,0:20:45.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  来办正事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.01,0:20:45.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's do this
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.18,0:20:51.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再来最后一步
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.18,0:20:51.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And the final touch
Dialogue: 1,0:20:57.40,0:20:58.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.40,0:20:58.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.95,0:21:05.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后  瞧好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.95,0:21:05.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And, voilà
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.99,0:21:08.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,货真价实的海绵宝宝本体
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.99,0:21:08.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One genuine SpongeBob SquarePants
Dialogue: 1,0:21:08.24,0:21:10.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,非凡卓越的煎炸厨师
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.24,0:21:10.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,fry cook extraordinaire
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.70,0:21:12.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你修好了我胳膊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.70,0:21:12.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You fixed my arms
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.62,0:21:15.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我冒昧把你旧的身体部位调整了下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.62,0:21:15.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I took the liberty of tuning up your old parts
Dialogue: 1,0:21:15.12,0:21:17.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,应该算是焕然一新了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.12,0:21:17.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They should be as good as new
Dialogue: 1,0:21:18.63,0:21:20.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,检测大脑获取餐点中
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.63,0:21:20.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Scanning brain for order
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.26,0:21:23.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没要点餐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.26,0:21:23.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not ordering
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.17,0:21:26.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只会如饥似渴地想要做蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.17,0:21:26.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The only thing I'm hungry for is flipping patties
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.38,0:21:28.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要不要我给你做个蟹黄堡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.38,0:21:28.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How about I cook a Krabby Patty for you?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:29.85,0:21:31.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,客人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.85,0:21:31.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Customer
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.77,0:21:32.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,做蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.77,0:21:32.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,cook patty?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.35,0:21:36.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给  尝一口吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.35,0:21:36.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go on, give it a taste
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.40,0:21:46.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,美味
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.40,0:21:46.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Delicious
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.70,0:21:48.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好吃的蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.70,0:21:48.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What a tasty patty
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.67,0:21:57.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.67,0:21:57.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.08,0:22:01.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来蟹黄堡的汁水不是很健康
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.08,0:22:01.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Guess all those patty juices weren't too healthy
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.42,0:22:04.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没法给海绵钢骨的机械胃消化
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.42,0:22:04.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for SpongeBorg's mechanical digestion
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.09,0:22:06.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我都同情起这个小家伙了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.09,0:22:06.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I feel bad for the little guy
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.30,0:22:09.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他真的很看重高质量的蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.30,0:22:09.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He really cared about a quality patty
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.84,0:22:12.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事  我有个职位要给他
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.84,0:22:12.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I have a job for him
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.31,0:22:15.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让他安安静静  不失尊严地发光发热
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.31,0:22:15.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that will maintain his sense of quiet dignity
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.44,0:22:19.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.44,0:22:19.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.27,0:22:21.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.27,0:22:21.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.19,0:22:22.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.19,0:22:22.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.69,0:22:26.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,需要点餐吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.69,0:22:26.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,May I take your order?
